# In `secrets/` we ALLOW only sops-encrypted YAML files (.enc.yaml).
# Plaintext YAML, .env files, decrypted dumps — all blocked.
# Anti-pattern A11 (dev-guide §11): inline secrets in any file.

# Block everything by default
*

# Allow this gitignore + the encrypted files
!.gitignore
!*.enc.yaml
!README.md
